(text "USB3-ONLY HUB OVER SFP+ — ELECTRICAL DRAFT" (at 15.24 12.7 0) (effects (font (size 2.2 2.2)) (justify left top)) (uuid "a7fc6665-8c43-53d2-9678-0cbe22b64c89"))
(text "Optical interface NOT YET CONNECTED: resolve Rx.Detect, LFPS, idle and disconnect behavior.\nSFP_TD/RD and SSTX0/SSRX0 are intentionally separate nets until that circuit is qualified." (at 15.24 81.28 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "b7cc19dc-e45b-5612-984c-809391a58585"))
(text "No USB2 data routing: all ten hub D+/D- pins and all USB-A D+/D- contacts are NC.\nNC does not remove the hub's need for the specified power rails and configuration." (at 15.24 101.6 0) (effects (font (size 1.5 1.5)) (justify left top)) (uuid "06b00dc7-67a5-5fb6-bdbd-fc8a9c570540"))
(text "PENDING: power/clock/port qualification, pin 40 disposition, SSREXT value, reset/VBUS policy,\nVBUS/input protection, signal ESD layout/testing, SFP controller/filter, firmware and module qualification." (at 15.24 266.7 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "887eb310-7a2b-5f33-b5dc-0ee32f9aeb22"))
(text "Pin 20 = GND; pin 21 = float; pin 57 = NC (normal mode).\nSource: supplied VL813.pdf pp.8–11; SFP contacts: SFF-8431 Table 3.\nPin names / critical dispositions checked; operation NOT verified." (at 15.24 127 0) (effects (font (size 1.3 1.3)) (justify left top)) (uuid "8088d61c-feeb-5024-83a5-79eb81e26605"))
